# The declared provider-free holdout JUDGED-REDUCTION stage (`VAL-STUDY-004`).
# It reduces the FROZEN blinded judge and independent-adjudication receipts of
# the heldout candidates together with the independently materialized reference
# population into the canonical per-arm classification: each candidate's
# declared verdict, the per-task/per-arm finding-level counts and the honest
# summary. It reuses the ONE canonical `Attune.Study.ReviewBenchJudge`
